{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“张量-同态伴随”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"张量-同态伴随"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 (不一定交换的) 环 $R,S$, 设 $M$ 为左 $R$ 右 $S$ 模, 则有一对"},{"Local":{"url":"伴随","text":"伴随"}},{"Plain":"函子\n$$\r\n(M\\otimes_S - ) \\dashv \\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,-)\\colon  R\\mathsf {Mod} \\longleftrightarrows S\\mathsf {Mod}.\r\n$$\n即对左 $S$-模 $A$ 与左 $R$-模 $B$, 有自然同构\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M\\otimes_S A ,B) \\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_S(A, \\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,B)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"代数-几何对偶","text":"代数-几何对偶"}},{"Plain":"中, 这对伴随可类比"},{"Local":{"url":"直像-逆像伴随","text":"直像-逆像伴随"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>$M\\otimes_S -$ 为右正合函子, 而 $\\operatorname{Hom}_R(M,-)$ 为左正合函子.</p>\n<p>若 $M$ 为平坦 $S$-模, 则 $M\\otimes_S -$ 同时也是左正合函子.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Frobenius互反律","text":"Frobenius 互反律"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"标量扩张","text":"标量扩张"}},{"Plain":" $\\dashv$ "},{"Local":{"url":"标量限制","text":"标量限制"}},{"Plain":" $\\dashv$ "},{"Local":{"url":"标量余扩张","text":"标量余扩张"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}